{"id":"665211","name":"猪肝炒彩椒","author":"putimama","authorId":"8334261","desc":"","cover":"images/665211/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"猪肝","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"黄彩椒","amount":"1个"},{"name":"绿彩椒","amount":"1个"},{"name":"蒜蓉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"猪肝洗净切成片。","img":"images/665211/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"蒜蓉。","img":"images/665211/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"彩椒切成丝状。","img":"images/665211/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中放适量的食用油烧热，先炒猪肝至无血取出。","img":"images/665211/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"再下入彩椒稍炒一下。","img":"images/665211/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入炒好的猪肝，料酒、生抽、盐、蒜蓉、快速翻炒即可出锅。","img":"images/665211/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"可淋入适量的淀粉水。","img":"images/665211/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"淋入淀粉水快炒出锅。","img":"images/665211/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品出锅装盘，猪肝需快炒才嫩不柴。","img":"images/665211/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}